OL,3,GNEWSAWoman trapped under car suffers   
OL,4,Aserious injuries                       
OL,6,FA woman who became trapped under her   
OL,7,Fcar in West Sussex has been left with  
OL,8,Fserious injuries.                      
OL,10,FSussex Police found the woman while    
OL,11,Fresponding to an incident in Durrington
OL,12,FLane, Worthing, at 18:15 GMT on Friday.
OL,14,FShe was taken to the hospital for      
OL,15,Ftreatment, Sussex Police said.         
OL,17,FThe road was closed for more than two  
OL,18,Fhours as emergency services where at   
OL,19,Fthe scene.                             
